{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a crew of outcasts with various goals, tastes and motivations. Explore the contaminated hellscapes surrounding the mining tower, gather enough food each day and try to return alive to keep growing stronger.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/extras/f89a27b972c4646810cb4d10f80dfb9a.avif?t=1771964310\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day select 3 crew members into your exploration crew. Every crew member has unique skills that will help you progress.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various biomes, from lush forests and wild mountains to deep mines of the Concern Operation.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Try to find new crew members, way forward, or at least something to eat today.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to find any hidden deathly traps!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch fish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart your enemies, scare them, stun them!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/extras/a50c520bd663c3e1b91aa2ffe9e0c4c3.avif?t=1771964310\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time action combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot! Block! Parry! Stun! Butcher? Lick?? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each crew member has their own selection of combat moves. Select your crew carefully to defeat the enemies and bosses populating the area.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEED YOUR CREW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/extras/769348a4c2fdfe292b4597fcce440b5e.avif?t=1771964310\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeding your crew is how you grow stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crew member has some food preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mushrooms! Fish! Meat! Canned Beans? Old shoe??</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get them their favorite snack and make them happy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get them something they hate, and watch them suffer. (you should not do this)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose all your HP during exploration, you also lose all your food.\u00a0 (you should not do this)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647070?t=1771964310","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/a1755d351d64567b3dcfa4dee899a6fe0c67c2e4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771964310","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/83c2f1516d6a96eb4ed46348efc77b569fec9f32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771964310","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/83c2f1516d6a96eb4ed46348efc77b569fec9f32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771964310","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4346440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a crew of outcasts with various goals, tastes and motivations. Explore the contaminated hellscapes surrounding the mining tower, gather enough food each day and try to return alive to keep growing stronger.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_ta